'''Mount Aku Invasion''' is an [[Invasion Stage]] that appears in [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku]] after clearing all stages in [[The Aku Realms]] stages. It introduces a new enemy, [[Lord of Ruin Jagando]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

Upon completion, [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando Jr.]] will be unlocked, a [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Ticket]] is awarded ([[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Ticket]] in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]), and the [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]] will permanently lose its ability to disable + levels, being replaced in any other stages with the [[Inactive Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Inactive Aku Altar]].

